{"id":"runc-events.8","n":"runc-events","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"runc","ver":"1.2.4-2.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/r/runc-1.2.4-2.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/runc-events.8.gz","sha256":"554c010523fb2701f379d74a809f71a929162016fe7a5f011aadbc935f33633e","date":"","origin":""},"u":{"pkg":"runc","ver":"1.3.4-0ubuntu1~22.04.1","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/r/runc-app/runc_1.3.4-0ubuntu1~22.04.1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/runc-events.8.gz","sha256":"1551d41d027969e141805f9687adcba746c332fa64e3c7ceb9261f842a33ff31","date":"","origin":""}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":2},"desc":"display container events and statistics.","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p><b>runc-events</b> - display container events and statistics.</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>runc events</b> [<i>option</i> ...] <i>container-id</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>The <b>events</b> command displays information about the container. By default, it works continuously, displaying stats every 5 seconds, and container events as they occur.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--interval</b> <i>time</i></dt><dd>Set the stats collection interval. Default is <b>5s</b>.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--stats</b></dt><dd>Show the container's stats once then exit.</dd></dl>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>runc</b>(8).</p>"]]}